OL,3,GNEWSAOfficers in forensic suits join
OL,4,Asearch for missing 20-year-old woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FForensic teams and police officers
OL,7,Fsearching for a missing 20-year-old
OL,8,Fwoman are focusing on a field yards
OL,9,Ffrom her home in Dumfries and Galloway.
OL,11,FKelsey Hunter was last seen in the
OL,12,FCotton Street area of Castle Douglas at
OL,13,Fabout 17:00 on Saturday.
OL,15,FDogs, a helicopter and specialist
OL,16,Fofficers have been involved in the
OL,17,Fsearch and there has been a large
OL,18,Fpolice presence around her home in the
OL,19,Fvillage of Springholm.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
